<title>USA: TABLE - Pfizer Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Pfizer Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.35		    $0.31</p>
<p> Net			457,000		  394,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,913,000		2,661,000</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.81		    $0.71</p>
<p> Net		    1,059,000		  911,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,914,000		5,343,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share restated to reflect two-for-one stock split on June 30.</p>
<p>First Call estimate for Q2 1997 was $0.36 per share.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Pfizer Inc.</p>
